          "label": "Deeply true of me"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "psyche_37",
      "text": "What drains me socially isn't people, it's surface-level small talk; an intense two-hour conversation about ideas actually leaves me more energized than sitting alone.",
      "module": "m7",
      "reverse": false,
      "options": [
