          "label": "Deeply true of me"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "psyche_38",
      "text": "Even with people I genuinely love, I hit an invisible social ceiling where I need quiet, unscheduled solitude to metabolize the day.",
      "module": "m7",
      "reverse": false,
      "options": [
        {
          "value": 1,
