          "label": "Deeply true of me"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "psyche_39",
      "text": "When something real is weighing on me, I prefer sitting down with one trusted person at a deliberate time rather than venting casually in a group.",
      "module": "m7",
      "reverse": false,
